<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TECHNIHIRE TALKS ONGOING, URGES CAUTION.</title>
<headline>TECHNIHIRE TALKS ONGOING, URGES CAUTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Technihire Ltd said on Friday it was still in continuing talks which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>A company notice warned shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no futher details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
